{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Real Art, Real Puzzles</strong><br>Solve puzzles crafted from <strong>authentic artworks by invited artists</strong>.<br>Each DLC is a curated collection \u2014 <strong>like visiting a new gallery of art.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/c6f1206e40314a5677ef798ef9ae6899.poster.avif?t=1759496581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/c6f1206e40314a5677ef798ef9ae6899.webm?t=1759496581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/c6f1206e40314a5677ef798ef9ae6899.mp4?t=1759496581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Curated Collections</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>4 free puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand with <strong>DLC packs featuring exclusive artworks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every artist brings a <strong>unique theme and vision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Features Built for Puzzle Lovers</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 levels with classic cuts</strong> (48\u2013432 pieces)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 levels with irregular cuts</strong> (48\u2013432 pieces)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zoom &amp; multi-selection</strong> for smooth control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Border filter, quadrant selector, shuffle &amp; reference image</strong> to guide yo